WHAT THIS FILE COVERS

  motion.pt        145,745 bytes
                   sha256 cf668f75b90d1abf73d2b87612a6e76bccc61ff7e083b63582d3f6aaa3c1759d

  This is Unitree Robotics' pre-trained G1 walk policy checkpoint, taken from
  their `unitree_rl_gym` project at `pre_train/g1/motion.pt`. It is a
  third-party binary artifact redistributed here unmodified; it is NOT
  OmniLink's work and is NOT covered by the Apache-2.0 grant in this
  repository's LICENSE file.

  In-tree evidence for that identification: the docstring of
  g1_unitree_deploy.py in this directory — "OmniSim deploy of UNITREE'S
  OFFICIAL G1 walk policy (unitree_rl_gym) / Runs Unitree's pre-trained
  pre_train/g1/motion.pt with their EXACT control stack" — and the control
  constants that script reproduces from Unitree's own deploy_mujoco.py /
  g1.yaml (per-joint kp/kd, action scale 0.25, 47-d observation layout,
  control_decimation=10).

  BSD 3-Clause clause 2 is why this file exists: a redistribution in binary
  form must reproduce the copyright notice, the list of conditions and the
  disclaimer "in the documentation and/or other materials provided with the
  distribution". This file is that material, and NOTICE +
  THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md carry the same attribution.

