UNRESOLVED — REQUIRES A MAINTAINER DECISION (do not assume it is settled)

  `unitree_rl_gym`'s TRAINING code descends from `legged_gym` (ETH Zürich,
  Robotic Systems Lab) and `rsl_rl`, whose BSD-3 notices are commonly reported
  to carry ETH Zürich and NVIDIA CORPORATION copyright lines in addition to the
  publisher's.

  Whether those notices attach to a TRAINED-WEIGHTS artifact — as opposed to
